{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34359","headline":"酬袭美见寄海蟹 · 陆龟蒙","name":"酬袭美见寄海蟹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"药杯应阻蟹螯香，却乞江边采捕郎。\n自是扬雄知郭索，且非何胤敢餦餭。\n骨清犹似含春霭，沫白还疑带海霜。\n强作南朝风雅客，夜来偷醉早梅傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}